# Never commit real Firebase native config or local env overrides. These
# are regenerated on demand via `firebase apps:sdkconfig` (see
# mobile/README.md "Firebase project setup") -- not secrets, just kept out
# of git as a matter of convention/regeneratable build input.
native-config/
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
.env.local
.env*.local

